{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Death by Laughter totems are altered only by a completed 10 second Corrupting Totem channel",
  "contract": [
    "rev_20261004_98_coa_corrupting_totem_channel makes the Taurine Totem 2300534 a goober whose use channels Corrupting",
    "Totem 256716 for 10 s, and spell_coa_corrupting_totem hands a completed channel to the totem, whose SmartAI then",
    "credits Totems altered (161849) for Death by Laughter 1660034. Expected: a channel cancelled after 3 s gives no",
    "credit; a full channel gives none at 5 s and one credit once the 10 s are up. The channel aims at an invisible",
    "floating stalker 23033 summoned inside the totem, so its visual runs from the player into the totem; the",
    "stalker is gone once the channel ends. Corrupting Totem reaches a totem 5 yd away and refuses one 8 yd away."
  ],
